![](/weird-guys.png "A picture of a woman holding some birds in her hand up for inspection. She is not impressed.")

This is a list of weird little guys in the free software movement and adjacent
spaces. Request additions, removals, or changes [via
email](mailto:drew@ddevault.org); patches welcome.

**Don't harass these people!** Don't engage with them at all.

[An RSS feed for this page is available]($link.page('weird-guys').alternative('rss')).

